      "name": "Global Variables",
      "description": {
        "content": "The **Global Variables** endpoints enable you to manage global [variables](https://learning.postman.com/docs/sending-requests/variables/). Global variables are available throughout a workspace and have the broadest scope in Postman.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
